From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:12:58 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: apple: macaudio: append variant identity after existing
 controls

Register the optional read-only identity control in late_probe, after the existing card and codec controls have been created. Their numeric identifiers remain stable when a board gains speaker-id-gpios.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit 6e7b99dc0bbac333b8fd640568e0715ad3bcb2a8)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c b/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
index b5511ed056..96cd57aae2 100644
--- a/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
+++ b/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
@@ -1507,9 +1507,6 @@ static int macaudio_probe(struct snd_soc_card *card)
 	snd_jack_set_key(ma->jack.jack, SND_JACK_BTN_2, KEY_VOLUMEDOWN);
 	snd_jack_set_key(ma->jack.jack, SND_JACK_BTN_3, KEY_VOICECOMMAND);
 
-	if (ma->speaker_id_gpios)
-		return snd_soc_add_card_controls(card, &macaudio_speaker_id_control, 1);
-
 	return ret;
 }
 
@@ -1634,6 +1631,13 @@ static int macaudio_late_probe(struct snd_soc_card *card)
 		mutex_unlock(&ma->volume_lock_mutex);
 	}
 
+	/* Append identity metadata without renumbering the existing controls. */
+	if (ma->speaker_id_gpios) {
+		ret = snd_soc_add_card_controls(card, &macaudio_speaker_id_control, 1);
+		if (ret)
+			return ret;
+	}
+
 	/* The notifier walks the card's controls: only while the card is bound */
 	return register_pm_notifier(&ma->pm_nb);
 }
